resourcepack/pirates-of-the-caribbean-mash-up\">神鬼奇航混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/pirates-of-the-caribbean-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/27e5KETs/31d474642f171b5501b9592a871f80a43c5b6e27_96.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Mass Effect Mash-up icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/mass-effect-mash-up\">質量效應混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mass-effect-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/iWaY0S0z/60dc005c96d9bc5c95807c711a36e5fb2e414f24.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Steampunk Texture Pack icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/steampunk-texture-pack\">蒸汽龐克材質包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/steampunk-texture-pack?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ee44YG5/d511ee3a7d36c90b76a84a640bf9586995da0f44.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Egyptian Mythology Mash-up icon\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/egyptian-mythology-mash-up\">埃及神話混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/egyptian-mythology-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n這個材質包是從舊版主機版的圖樣材質包移植而來，並更新了基岩版的材質。原始材質由 4J Studios 製作。\n</center>",
